lass="summary">Early players struggle with missing audio, absent tutorials, and clunky controls before finding direction.</p><div class="theme"><h3>Performance</h3><div class="claim"><p class="text">Reviewers report that the game lacks audio and sound effects.</p><details><summary><span class="tag mono">▸ 3 reviews</span><span class="cta">Show receipts</span></summary><div class="citation"><div class="meta mono">▼ does not recommend · 0.2 hrs · 2026-07-27</div><div class="body">audio was just completely mute</div></div><div class="citation"><div class="meta mono">▼ does not recommend · 1.1 hrs · 2026-05-31</div><div class="body">Nothing is explained (correctly) to you, and even if it were, it happens after it&#x27;s needed (e.g. combat tutorial appearing after you die, healing tutorial appearing only after you&#x27;ve healed yourself like wtf??)
